  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 314.02 Requirements and Limitations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 314.02 Requirements and Limitations.\n\n(a) A standard permit facility shall comply with:\n\n(1) Env-Sw 1000;\n\n(2) Env-Sw 1100, if the facility has an active life longer than 90 days;\n\n(3) Env-Sw 400 through Env-Sw 800, as applicable based on the functional classification of the facility;\n\n(4) Env-Sw 900, as applicable based on the type of waste managed by the facility; and\n\n(5) Env-Sw 1400.\n\n(b) A standard permit shall be subject to the provisions in Env-Sw 315 for permit modification.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300) #8462-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
